<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-046" chapter-id="c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness" source-id="s-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness-ws2118581">
  <p id="c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p001:m0000" ref="r5n_x7v_cwf_AC">倫之</persName>大喜，每載酒肴詣泰。五年，卒。子<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p001:m0018" ref="r5n_x7v_cwf_ACA">伯符</persName>嗣。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p002:m0000" ref="r5n_x7v_cwf_ACA">伯符</persName>字潤遠。少好弓馬。<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p002:m0011" ref="r5n_x7v_cwf_AC">倫之</persName>在襄陽，<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p002:m0017" ref="r5n_x7v_cwf_ACA">伯符</persName>為竟陵太守。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">典筆吏取筆不如意，鞭五十。子<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p003:m0014" ref="r5n_x7v_cwf_ACAA">倩</persName>，尚文帝第四女海鹽公主。初，始興王<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p003:m0032" ref="3b1_39e_aa6">濬</persName>以潘妃之寵，故得出入後宮，遂與公主私通。及適<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p003:m0055" ref="r5n_x7v_cwf_ACAA">倩</persName>，<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p003:m0057" ref="r5n_x7v_cwf_ACAA">倩</persName>入宮而怒，肆詈搏擊，引絕帳帶。事上聞，有詔離婚，殺主所生蔣美人，<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p003:m0090" ref="r5n_x7v_cwf_ACA">伯符</persName>慚懼發病卒。諡曰肅。傳國至孫<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p003:m0106" ref="r5n_x7v_cwf_ACA*A">勗</persName>，齊受禪，國除。</p>
</text>
